request.description:
Open this URL as a WebSocket request.

Send JSON message to subscribe to one or more sensors without reconnecting:

```json
{
  "type": "subscribe",
  "idsensor": ["{{sensor_code}}", "{{sensor_code_2}}"]
}
```

Expected response:

```json
{
  "type": "subscribe",
  "success": true,
  "message": "Subscribed to sensor room.",
  "data": {
    "rooms": ["00001", "00002"]
  }
}
```

When a device socket connects or disconnects, subscribed clients receive:

```json
{
  "type": "device_info",
  "success": true,
  "message": "Device info updated.",
  "data": [
    {
      "sensor_code": "00001",
      "connection_status": false,
      "ip_device": null,
      "connected_at": null
    }
  ]
}
```

Open this URL as a WebSocket request.

Send JSON message to unsubscribe from one or more sensors without disconnecting:

```json
{
  "type": "unsubscribe",
  "idsensor": ["{{sensor_code}}"]
}
```

Expected response:

```json
{
  "type": "unsubscribe",
  "success": true,
  "message": "Unsubscribed from sensor room.",
  "data": {
    "rooms": []
  }
}
```
